        "Market\n- [ ] I can describe one specific customer.\n- [ ] I understand the problem I am solving.\n- [ ] I have evidence that the customer cares about the problem.\n- [ ] I know how I will reach potential customers.\nDelivery\n- [ ] I can create a sample.\n- [ ] I know which parts AI handles and which parts I must review.\n- [ ] I can reproduce the result reliably.\n- [ ] I have a quality-control checklist.\n- [ ] I know what permissions and information I need.\nEconomics\n- [ ] I have checked normal tool pricing, not just a promotional offer.\n- [ ] I have included usage, platform, and operating costs.\n- [ ] I know how much time delivery takes.\n- [ ] I can explain how the service earns money.\n- [ ] I am not relying on unverified income claims.\nCustomer responsibility\n- [ ] The offer and scope are clear.\n- [ ] I know how revisions and support will work.\n- [ ] I can explain limitations honestly.\n- [ ] I have a plan for errors, refunds, escalation, or maintenance where relevant.\n- [ ] I will protect customer data and follow applicable rules."
